<Base title="About, editorial policy & affiliate disclosure | CreatorDeals" description="How CreatorDeals researches creator software, checks offers and discloses affiliate relationships."><h1>About CreatorDeals</h1><div class="prose"><p>CreatorDeals is an independent guide to software used in video, audio, and AI creation. We publish original buying notes based on practical workflow questions and link to official merchant sources.</p><h2>Offer policy</h2><p>We list an offer only when its public terms and date can be verified. Unverified codes, guessed discounts, and expired campaigns are excluded from active listings. Our daily refresh process moves dated offers into an expired archive.</p><h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2><p>We may earn a commission if a visitor buys through a future affiliate link. No affiliate integrations are active at launch. Compensation will not determine whether an unverified offer is shown.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For corrections, open an issue in the public project repository. Include the official source URL and observation date.</p></div></Base>
